; T-138: the elder's visual is the ONE shared rigged people scene (Visual,
; instancing scenes/people_rig.tscn) — the same model as the tourists, live
; clips for the T-137 shuffle. The near trust arm is the rig's rigid right
; arm on its BoneAttachment3D (the T-078 contract, driven by _arm_raise);
; the far arm rides the skinned clips. Hair mounts on the head bone; the
; cane is adopted into the bob/lean container at _ready. The grown capsule
; is the splat surface, matching the adult 1.75 m envelope.

